  storyText: "NCART Station\n\nKabuki station. Commuters, ads, NCPD drones scanning faces. Your face isn't flagged. Yet.\n\nThree options on the board: the south line to Pacifica, the north line to Northside, or the Delamain cab stand outside.\n\n1. Take the south line to Pacifica.\n2. Take the north line to Northside.\n3. Grab a Delamain cab."
